 "remarks": "Wonderful opportunity to live at Glenrock in this 2 BR 2 1/2 bath townhouse with attached garage parking, outdoor parking space and secure storage area plus laundry in the unit. Renovated kitchen with an abundance of natural light, fireplace in the living room with sliders to a private balcony. Enjoy the community pool, the BBQ deck and a welcoming entertainment area with pool cabanas, all surrounded by meticulously manicured landscaping and gardens. Conveniently located within walking distance to the Merritt 7 train station and business complexes. Offers many shopping places and restaurant options and just 45 minute commute by car or train to NYC. Immediate occupancy. A wonderful complex to call home!",
